---
import { business } from '../../data/business';
import { css } from '../../lib/css';
import Icon from '../Icon.astro';
const { phone, storePhone, mapUrl } = business;
const PHONE = phone;
const STORE_PHONE = storePhone;
const MAP_URL = mapUrl;
---
<section class="block" style={css({ paddingTop: 0 })}>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="final-cta">
      <h2>궁금한 건<br />전화로 편하게 물어보세요</h2>
      <p>청주·오창·오송 방문 실측 무료. “거실 커튼 얼마예요?” 한마디면 시작이에요.</p>
      <div style={css({ display: "flex", gap: 12, flexWrap: "wrap", justifyContent: "center" })}>
        <a class="btn btn-primary btn-xl" href={`tel:${PHONE}`}><Icon name="phone" size={18} /> 지금 전화 상담하기</a>
        <a class="btn btn-secondary-on-dark btn-xl" href={MAP_URL} target="_blank" rel="noopener"><Icon name="pin" size={18} /> 매장 방문하기</a>
      </div>
      <div style={css({ marginTop: 22, fontSize: 14, color: "var(--charcoal)", display: "flex", flexWrap: "wrap", justifyContent: "center", columnGap: 14, rowGap: 4 })}>
        <span><span style={css({ color: "var(--steel)" })}>매장</span> {STORE_PHONE}</span>
        <span><span style={css({ color: "var(--steel)" })}>휴대폰</span> {PHONE}</span>
        <span style={css({ color: "var(--steel)" })}>{business.hours.display}</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
